            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Nebukadineza nasita ahambi khumuliango kweshisambilo shiomulilo omululumu; naboola mbu Shadaraka, Meshaki, naAbedinego, inywe abasumba baNyasaye Ouli Ikulu Muno, rule, mwitse hano. Nabo Shadaraka, Meshaki, naAbedinego nibarula mumulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abaami nabasinjilili nabakafuna nabakofu beshiina shiomuruchi nibakhung'aanaho nibalola abandu abo, shinga omulilo olwa kurabeele nobunyali bwosi khumibili chiabwe, kata liswi liemirwe chiabwe okhusambwa, kata tsingubo tsiabwe tsifuubila okhuyia, kata okhuhunya khwomulilo okhuba khubo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza naboola mbu Nyasaye waShadaraka, Meshaki, naAbedinego yeetsoomibwe! Niye owaruma malaikawe nahonia abasumbabe abamwisiikanga, nibakhaya likhuwa liomuruchi, nibahaana emibili chiabwe buhaana, mbu baleshe okhukhalabanila kata okhwinamila omunyasaye yesi, habula Nyasaye wabwe yenyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano ekhupa omulome, mbu ababuli luyia nabuli lihanga nabuli lulimi abakhaboola likhuwa liosi libii khuNyasaye waShadaraka, Meshaki, naAbedinego, balatonywe ebitonye ebitonye, tsinzu tsiabwe nitsilikululwa pe; shichila abulaho omunyasaye undi yesi ounyala okhuhonia abandu ario ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
